/> <br /> Released in 1996, Arcadia: The Wyld Hunt, a collectible card game, offered Changeling: The Dreaming players a tantalizing glimpse into Arcadia. The game allowed players to create their own character with which to explore the heart of the Dreaming. Most of the character options were those found in Changeling, but intriguingly, a handful never made their way into the role-playing game \u2014 until now.<br /> <br /> <b>Heroes arise to face the Darkening!</b><br /> <br /> Kiths of Arcadia presents the seven never before published kiths from Arcadia: The Wyld Hunt for use in Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition chronicles:<ul><li>Army Ant Platoons</li> <li>Dragonkin</li> <li>Imps</li> <li>Mechorgs</li> <li>Nagas</li> <li>Renegade Cogs</li> <li>Tritons</li> </ul><hr />What is Radio Free Arcadia? Releases under the Radio Free Arcadia banner come straight from the heart of the Dreaming! Any work featuring the Radio Free Arcadia logo was created by one or more people who worked on the Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition game line. These titles feature experienced writers with professional attention to detail.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":". 01-08-2020, 04:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-26T21:42:21-08:00","id":1357159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"videoconta