-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1357101-kiths-of-arcadia?p=1357296#post1357296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can you update this thread and let me know when the book is released?</div> </div> </div> </div>I will! I'm just waiting on a few more final art pieces. It'll be released as soon as I have them all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-28T18:45:49-08:00","id":1357434,"title":"","content":"Thank you!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T11:33:58-08:00","id":1357840,"title":"","content":"Color me intrigued. I've been writing a lot of new Kiths myself, and always like to see the takes others have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3988-windthin","name":"Windthin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3988_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T12:59:33-08:00","id":1357867,"title":"","content":"I collected the game and remember loving the concept, with the hope that some of the new kiths would get the nod into the RPG. As an aside, though, weren't (D)Jinn available as a kith as well? I would like to say I remember that I had one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;At the risk of sounding like a murder hobo&quot;<br /> <br /> Attributed to Nyrufa.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24134-inertial-frame","name":"Inertial Frame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-30T15:15:46-08:00","id":1357890,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24134-inertial-frame\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24134_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24134\" data-vbnamecard=\"24134\">Inertial Frame</a> the Jinn are in C20 Players Guide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T08:34:49-08:00","id":1358008,"title":"","content":"Ah, I didn't realize. I don't have it, yet, so I had no idea. Thank you, <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;At the risk of sounding like a murder hobo&quot;<br /> <br /> Attributed to Nyrufa.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24134-inertial-frame","name":"Inertial Frame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"157"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T13:52:11-08:00","id":1358073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Inertial Frame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1357101-kiths-of-arcadia?p=1358008#post1358008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah, I didn't realize. I don't have it, yet, so I had no idea. Thank you, <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>.</div> </div> </div> </div>More properly, 'Jinn' in C20 is a term the Middle Eastern changelings use to refer to themselves and other supernaturals. Djinn, however, is used only for the beings of that name referenced in legends and sacred texts.<br /> <br /> Your memory's right on remembering Djinn as a kith in Arcadia, but that version's not been ported over to the RPG.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T14:22:00-08:00","id":1358081,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"51\" data-vbnamecard=\"51\">marin</a> so the Jinn from C20 and the Djinn from Mage are two different beings?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T16:30:37-08:00","id":1358099,"title":"","content":"For the purposes of Kiths of Arcadia, the Jinn from the C20 Players Guide covers the Djinn from the card game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T19:30:20-08:00","id":1358126,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar648_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"648\" data-vbnamecard=\"648\">PookaKnight</a> awesome!!<br /> <br /> Since you\u2019re a writer, I wanted to ask you a question. One of the Jinn kiths from C20 is called the afreet. They sound A LOT like the Djinn from Lost Paths. Is the similarity intentional? Thanks \ud83d\ude0a.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T19:55:33-08:00","id":1358129,"title":"","content":"I did the Lycians in the Players Guide, so I can\u2019t speak for the person who wrote the Jinn. It might have been an intentional nod, or it could have been just a result of both pulling from the same sources. It\u2019s pretty easy to do when you\u2019re drawing on real world myths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-31T22:20:20-08:00","id":1358145,"title":"","content":"That makes sense. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-01T13:53:00-08:00","id":1358241,"title":"","content":"Refresh.. refresh... refresh","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"